    "details": "The Podman developers report:\n\n> This release addresses (CVE-2025-11395), where importing images\n> containing crafted layer tarballs with the podman load command, or\n> importing volumes containing crafted symlinks with podman volume\n> import, allows overwriting files on the host.\n>\n> This release also addresses CVE-2026-79699 and CVE-2026-79705, though\n> we do not believe these CVEs are exploitable through the Podman\n> command line.\n",
